#: ../../packages/integration-discord/src/features/backups/index.ts
msgctxt "discord-integration.pcZWbD"
msgid "Everything currently on the server's disk will be replaced by the contents of this backup. The server is stopped while it is restored, and anything created since the backup was taken is lost."
msgstr "Allt som just nu finns på serverns disk ersätts med innehållet i den här säkerhetskopian. Servern stoppas under återställningen och allt som skapats sedan säkerhetskopian togs går förlorat."

#: ../../packages/integration-discord/src/features/backups/index.ts
