msgid "Remove card"
msgstr "Ta bort kort"

#: src/features/account/components/billing/remove-payment-method-dialog.tsx
msgctxt "mLXaQO"
msgid "It is detached from our payment provider straight away and can never be charged again. Receipts for payments you have already made are unaffected."
